#### 4. Mystery Guest

**File:** `OrderProcessorTests.cs` · **Method:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (lines 139–148)

```csharp
var orders = processor.ImportOrders(
    File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv"));
```

**Problem:** Depends on an external file at a hardcoded Windows path. The test will fail on any machine that doesn't have `C:\TestData\orders.csv` — CI, macOS/Linux, a teammate's workstation. This also exhibits **Resource Optimism** (assumes the file exists without checking).

**Fix — use inline test data:**

```csharp
[TestMethod]
public void ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly()
{
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory);
    var csvContent = "SKU,Qty\nSKU-1,2\nSKU-2,1\nSKU-3,3\nSKU-4,1\nSKU-5,1";

    var orders = processor.ImportOrders(csvContent);

    Assert.AreEqual(5, orders.Count);
}
```

**Risk if unfixed:** Test is non-portable; fails in CI or on any other machine; impossible to review test data without finding the external file.

